{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In DOSTAVKA, you're not just facing an alien invasion \u2014 you're also stuck working a fast-food shift\u2026 and that might be even worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your coworker forgot to pack a drink in a customer's order. Now it's up to you to chase down the delivery driver and save your spotless reputation \u2014 well, as spotless as a broke college student can afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a hardcore 3D platformer with a quirky story, surreal level design, and an original soundtrack by MOLINEA. The visual style is light yet vibrant, inspired by somewhere in Eastern Europe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Originally built as a single-player experience, DOSTAVKA also features online co-op for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new movement abilities as you progress \u2014 like double jump, wall running, dash, rocket jump, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random chaos awaits: from tornadoes to lava rain and meteor showers, no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Packed with Easter eggs \u2014 try to find a few (or all of them)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/0365d6073c018c9d1774d0112839af93.avif?t=1753061613\" /></div>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash \u2013 Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow time \u2013 Right Mouse Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grappling hook \u2013 Left Mouse Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spawn platform \u2013 E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rocket jump \u2013 Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restart level \u2013 R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch character \u2013 G</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectator mode \u2013 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run mode toggle \u2013 F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun \u2014 and good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an alpha version, and we\u2019ve got a lot more coming. We promise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/acdceb9377390286d1c70d4d67f8517d.poster.avif?t=1753061613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/acdceb9377390286d1c70d4d67f8517d.webm?t=1753061613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/acdceb9377390286d1c70d4d67f8517d.mp4?t=1753061613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773750?t=1753061613","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/23282ef2baada5cc90dffedecaa97d756249706f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753061613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/ded7e1776a1f08b2b202bbda9954a0da2e9d7f20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753061613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/ded7e1776a1f08b2b202bbda9954a0da2e9d7f20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753061613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In DOSTAVKA, you're not just facing an alien invasion \u2014 you're also stuck working a fast-food shift\u2026 and that might be even worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your coworker forgot to pack a drink in a customer's order. Now it's up to you to chase down the delivery driver and save your spotless reputation \u2014 well, as spotless as a broke college student can afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a hardcore 3D platformer with a quirky story, surreal level design, and an original soundtrack by MOLINEA. The visual style is light yet vibrant, inspired by somewhere in Eastern Europe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Originally built as a single-player experience, DOSTAVKA also features online co-op for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new movement abilities as you progress \u2014 like double jump, wall running, dash, rocket jump, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random chaos awaits: from tornadoes to lava rain and meteor showers, no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Packed with Easter eggs \u2014 try to find a few (or all of them)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/0365d6073c018c9d1774d0112839af93.avif?t=1753061613\" /></div>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash \u2013 Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow time \u2013 Right Mouse Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grappling hook \u2013 Left Mouse Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spawn platform \u2013 E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rocket jump \u2013 Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restart level \u2013 R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch character \u2013 G</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectator mode \u2013 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run mode toggle \u2013 F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun \u2014 and good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an alpha version, and we\u2019ve got a lot more coming. We promise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/acdceb93